# Schema Alignment: 4D Order/OrderLine to WebClerk3 Sales Order/Sales Order Line

This document outlines the schema alignment between the legacy 4D database Order and OrderLine tables and the modern WebClerk3 sales_order and sales_order_line models.

## Overview

The 4D schema uses individual fields for most data, while WebClerk3 consolidates many fields into JSONB objects for flexibility and extensibility. The key WebClerk3 structures are:

- `.metadata`: Stores additional data without defined fields
- `.prefs`: User preferences and configuration
- `.refs`: Denormalized relationships and links

